# Reproduction pass (19 findings, one isolated-worktree Opus 5.5 agent each)

## F15 — REPRODUCED (agent severity: high, confidence 0.9)

**Reasoning.** Reproduced end to end with the real code: runtime::initialize_with_policy, the real MatrixTransport (matrix-sdk Client::send) against the axum loopback mock homeserver, and the real Store. The test simulates three restarts on one archive.

Run 1: config is alias #eng (resolving to ROOM) plus ROOM2. Both rooms are ready. A sync commits s1, and ROOM's base history is completed via apply_history_page.

